            <div xml:id="d570">

                <pb facs="0467" n="455" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg455"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00112 European War 1939/4927: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chargé at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Childs</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-03-28T16:00:00-04:00">March 28, 1942—4
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>55. Your 116, March 13. If possible, please postpone your dinner for subject
                    pending receipt of letter which Department is sending you by quickest available
                    means.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
